  "title": "Zucchini Lasagna",
  "description": "This low-carb zucchini lasagna is made with thin layers of zucchini, beef marinara, ricotta, and mozzarella for a delicious noodle-free lasagna.",
  "authors": [
    "Fioa"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-09-03T17:57:55-04:00",
